    "correctness": "Exact original source fragment against the new helper; empty/small/equal/over65536/max32x97x97, distance ties, ordered/reverse/random/radial scenes, caps0/49/65536/larger than input, all complete candidate bytes. A final tie-breaking negative control is required before any promotion.",
